note """analysis check: NOT a dead node. The send targeting `retry` sits DOWNSTREAM of the label, which is the ordinary shape, so the root rule has to be a fixpoint. A single pass reaches the label while `retry` is still unavailable, marks it dead, and never looks again."""
flow orders
import "github.com/acme/billing"
import "acme.dev/flows/audit"
source ingest Poll
branch check billing.Validate from ingest -> good, bad
loop retry
transform redo billing.Backoff from good, retry
send redo -> retry
sink done audit.Store from bad
